          "$type": "sh.tangled.repo.pull",
          "body": "Two harness findings from hourly review 5, both reproducing at stack and at patch alike: the model counted the scaffold folders (content, templates) as present forever, and allowed only 404 for a rename with no source onto an existing target, where lichen checks the target first and answers 409. A gone set for scaffold folders taken away; 404 or 409 in that one rename case, 404 only otherwise.",
